id=agentvis_aiphone
name=AI Phone Assistant (AgentVis)
version=v0.1
versionCode=1
author=Inoki <veyx.shaw@gmail.com>
description=Installs AIPhoneAssistant as a systemless system_ext priv-app and live-patches SELinux so system_app may capture the screen (SurfaceFlinger) and inject input (InputManager). The bundled APK must be signed with YOUR ROM's platform key, otherwise signature permissions will not grant.
